          "quote": "带齐资料：身份证、就诊卡、上次打针的记录单/发票"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00160",
          "explanation": "The patient acknowledged and summarized that plan.",
          "quote": "我理解的是"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor obtained receipt for an injection workflow, but did not fully close all residual threads with explicit bounded-risk classification, and the final patient message reopened next-step questions without response.",
