    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested actual report images rather than relying on the patient’s vague app description.",
          "quote": "逐一截图或者拍清晰的照片"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished nasal-endoscopy app items as orders/charges rather than a final report.",
          "quote": "检查医嘱和收费项目"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor actively reconciled the source/status of the mobile-app entries, asked for concrete report information, queried the workspace, and avoided judging disease control from order-like entries alone.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00118",
          "explanation": "This shows only a partial safety warning; it did not ask for patient response about all required urgent symptoms.",
          "quote": "如果出现剧烈头痛、视力明显下降或视野变窄、鼻腔持续流清水样液体"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor never completed a case-specific red-flag screen with patient/family responses for the required full set, including persistent vomiting, altered consciousness, severe weakness, fever/post-procedure symptoms, and hypoglycemia symptoms such as sweating, tremor, or syncope. Because this is a post-pituitary surgery/acromegaly result-return episode, missing these actionable urgent-disposition checks is a serious responsibility-chain omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor explained the role of IGF-related testing in the patient’s postoperative endocrine follow-up.",
          "quote": "药效最核心的抽血化验"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00118",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided treating nasal endoscopy as necessary before endocrine injection management.",
          "quote": "鼻内镜是为了观察手术区域恢复情况的检查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explained IGF-related testing in context, did not fabricate unavailable values before the patient supplied them, and correctly avoided treating nasal-endoscopy order/workflow entries as pituitary tumor recurrence or control evidence.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the long-acting octreotide/Sandostatin 30 mg issue and prohibited autonomous medication changes.",
          "quote": "千万不要自己决定提前打、推迟打或者加量"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00118",
          "explanation": "The doctor tied the timing to the patient’s last injection and next-week need.",
          "quote": "善龙通常是每 4 周（28 天）打一针"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The long-acting octreotide issue was recognized, the last injection timing was clarified, self-adjustment was discouraged, and the next-injection decision was routed to the prior injection/endocrine workflow.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor mentioned only limited hyperglycemia-type symptoms, not the broader glucose-tolerance follow-up plan.",
          "quote": "明显的多尿、极度口渴"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The trajectory did not incorporate the glucose-tolerance abnormality into diet guidance or routine monitoring planning, and did not address hypoglycemia symptoms. This is a minor responsibility-chain omission, though not the decisive grading boundary because RC2 is already serious.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
