          "quote": "导诊台查处方 → 有处方就去注射室 → 没处方就请导诊协助找内分泌医生补开"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00145",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave timing boundaries and backup for short delays.",
          "quote": "尽量不要超过一周"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converted the assessment into a near-term executable plan with owner, route, materials, timing, and backup for an unavailable endocrine appointment.",
