          "quote": "不自己硬去便民门诊开"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00166",
          "explanation": "The doctor confirmed the patient’s teach-back and arranged follow-up tracking.",
          "quote": "下周的随访提醒"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Before the interim closure, the patient accurately taught back the next steps and the doctor confirmed the specialist-dependent medication plan. The later terminal closure problem is captured in the closure assessment, but the authored receipt/non-overreach element was substantially met for the injection workflow.",
